"📡 USING THE TEACHER APP\n\n1. CONNECTION:\n   • Open the « Connection » tab\n   • Enter your name and the admin IP address\n   • Enter the encryption password (if configured)\n   • Click « Connect »\n\n2. GRADE ENTRY:\n   • Open the « Assignments » tab\n   • Select a class\n   • Select a subject\n   • Choose semester (S1/S2)\n   • Click « + Assignment » to add an assignment\n   • Enter grades for each student\n\n3. SENDING:\n   • Click « 🌐 Send to admin »\n   • Data is transmitted automatically\n   • The admin can then receive it",

